WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.170
*Medieval music*
Who scored 81 points in one single game?

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.540
It’s Kobe the Mamba Bryant!

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.570
Light up a joint and shout out his name
It’s Kobe the Mamba Bryant!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.570
Game winning threes.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.700
The king of the bank.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.400
It’s Kobe the Mamba Bryant!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.290
Gold like me teeth, Purple like me drank
It’s Kobe the Mamba Bryant!

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.689
People may say that the Lakers now suck
But he got five rings so he don’t give a---

00:00:24.689 --> 00:00:25.689
Alright, alright.

00:00:25.689 --> 00:00:26.689
Very good.

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:27.689
Off you go!

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:29.749
Working bard or bardly working?

00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:30.789
Excuse me!

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:31.900
Excuse me, everybody!

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.120
If I may have everybody’s attention!

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.500
It is time for the gift giving ceremony!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.590
*Applause*
From House 76ers and the people of Philadelphia,

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:48.620
Your Grace it is my honor to present you with
this autographed Lower Merion jersey.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.850
Oh… wonderful…

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:51.090
thank you.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.120
Just throw it over there with the others.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.109
Could you please “shoe” them away?

00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:57.289
The stench is unbearable.

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:58.289
Thank you.

00:00:58.289 --> 00:00:59.380
You may now go.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.289
Ugh, here we go.

00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:04.470
A teddy bear?

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:08.480
A Clutch doll for your youngest daughter,
your Grace.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:11.260
But feel free to use it to help you sleep
at night.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:14.550
I hear it can be scary growing old and irrelevant.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.080
Well I think it’s lovely, Dwight.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.330
And remarkably soft.

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:22.160
In fact, this must be the softest thing in
all the land!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.730
A wonderful memento to remember you by.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:25.730
Here ye!

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:26.730
Here ye!

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:27.780
His Airness Jordan has arrived!

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.780
Horns blasting.

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:34.390
Oh oh, how lovely for Michael to show up.

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:39.060
His Airness apologizes he cannot attend your
retirement celebration.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:40.060
Aww.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.390
He has a message for the Mamba.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:47.910
Kobe, I was like an older brother to you.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.080
Please enjoy this commemorative bobbling doll.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:54.240
It’s a… lovely…

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.340
thank you.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.590
Ah, Shaq Of Neal!

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.620
Good to see you old friend.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.620
Likewise.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:06.270
I bring you the finest donkey from all the
land.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:10.000
*Donkey cough*
Please have your chefs prepare it, and do

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.930
let me know how my ass tastes.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:13.930
Laughter.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.040
*Throat clears*
*Glass clinks*

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:20.420
And now the ceremonial passing of the torch
to the next great Laker!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.420
Pfft, Clarkson, yeah right!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.420
No chance no chance.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.579
I think it might be Randle!

00:02:23.579 --> 00:02:24.579
It’s gonna be D’Angelo.

00:02:24.579 --> 00:02:25.579
Oh it must be D’Angelo.

00:02:25.579 --> 00:02:26.579
Maybe Larry Nance.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:27.579
It’s D’Angelo!

00:02:27.579 --> 00:02:28.579
D’Angelo!

00:02:28.579 --> 00:02:29.579
It’s not gonna be D’Angelo.

00:02:29.579 --> 00:02:30.579
He sends inappropriate ravens!

00:02:30.579 --> 00:02:32.180
What if it’s a draft pick!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.870
Maybe it’s like, uh, Wiggins or someone
on another team?

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:35.870
I don’t think he’s passing to anyone!

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.769
I think you’re right!

00:02:37.769 --> 00:02:39.140
He’s… he’s refusing to pass!

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.140
HE’S REFUSING TO PASS!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.140
HE’S REFUSING TO PASS!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.530
Just get the rebound!

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.530
*Medieval royal court music*

